# === IDE / Tooling ===
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# === Lexy-specific: Runtime data (sessions, memory, plugin DBs, logs) ===
#
# ``data/`` ist der Catch-all für alle Runtime-Daten. Konkret abgedeckt:
#   * data/sessions.json (+ .bak)         — Conversation-History (Chat + RP)
#   * data/projects.json                   — Projekt-Definitionen
#   * data/memory/                         — FTS-Indices, Memory-State
#   * data/uploads/                        — User-Uploads (Bilder, PDFs, Code, Audio)
#   * data/plugins/character_chat/         — Charaktere + Avatare + Lorebooks + Lore-Entries
#   * data/plugins/scheduler/              — Timer / Pulses / Wecker
#   * data/plugins/coder/                  — Approval-Audit-Log (Phase 10.B/C)
#   * data/plugins/{dashboard,orchestrator,
#                   rp_director,skill_writer,
#                   knowledge_acquisition,
#                   expert_panel,spotify}/  — State pro Plugin
#   * data/certs/                          — TLS-Zertifikate (private keys!)
# Keine Ausnahmen — ALLES unterhalb von data/ gehört nicht ins Repo.
data/
logs/
*.log
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-journal
*.bak

# === Lexy Self-Coding Workspace (Phase 10.B/C) ===
#
# Lexy schreibt hier eigene Skills + Projekte rein, jeweils mit
# eigenem .venv pro Skill (kann GB-groß werden). Inhalt ändert sich
# ständig und ist machine-spezifisch — nichts davon gehört ins Repo.
# Falls du jemals einen Skill explizit ins Repo legen willst, mach's
# außerhalb des Workspace-Verzeichnisses (z.B. unter plugins/).
workspace/
workspace_test/

# === LLM binaries + models (never in git) ===
llama.cpp/
*.gguf
*.bin
*.safetensors

# === Junctions to external sources (Windows mklink /J targets) ===
# These are symlinks to other directories on the local machine that must
# not be dereferenced into this repo.
/docs/
/lexy_v1/
# Avatar GLB/glTF assets live in G:\AI\LexyAI\assets\models\ on the
# local machine; the frontend folder is a junction so Babylon can
# fetch them at runtime. Never index that target into git.
/frontend/static/avatar-world/assets/models/
/frontend/static/avatar-world/assets/backgrounds/
/frontend/static/avatar-world/assets/animations/
/frontend/static/avatar-world/assets/apartment/
/frontend/static/vendor/babylon/

# === Reference programs (third-party, out of scope for this repo) ===
/referenz/

# === Frontend build artifacts (if a node build ever resumes) ===
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/.next/
frontend/dist/
frontend/build/

# === Local config overrides (keep secrets out) ===
config/config.local.yaml
config/*.local.yaml

# === OS ===
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# === Temp / uploads ===
data/plugins/*/uploads/
tmp/
*.tmp
